\name{twoStep2Phase-package}
\alias{twoStep2Phase-package}
\alias{twoStep2Phase}
\title{Two-Step Estimation for Two-Phase Studies}
\description{
Utilities and prototype estimators for the update-estimation approach in
"An optimal two-step estimation approach for two-phase studies".
}
\details{
The package provides one generator and one analysis function for each of the
linear, logistic, and Cox settings. Analysis functions support kernel, linear,
and generalized additive working models based on any available Phase I
auxiliary variables: an optional surrogate measurement and optional cheap
covariates. Linear and logistic outcome models may include an intercept.
}
\keyword{package}
